      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COME AND SEE (5) is a classy pup building a strong winning record at the journey. Has been on speed to score at her last couple of runs. Scored latest at this track in a handy 22.12. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Looks the one to beat. DOONGALLA ROCKET (4) has a strong record here with three wins and a minor from five starts. Placed last time (23.65) at Horsham in a Free For All, finishing third and beaten 5 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. NAUGHTY NORM (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind COME AND SEE (22.40) in a Free For All. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading player again. SOMETHING GOOD (7) can feature with the right run.",
